{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar brand copy (2026-10-14) — "Jouw dagelijkse douchepartner".

  One place for the brand messaging used by the brand sections (hero, brand
  intro, trust & support, guides and the About page), localized for every
  published storefront language: nl (primary), en, de, fr, es. Written per
  language rather than translated word for word.

  Usage:
    {%- capture v -%}{% render 'besjaar-brand-copy', key: 'hero_heading' %}{%- endcapture -%}

  Placeholders [days] and [months] are replaced by the calling section with
  the theme settings return_window_days and warranty_months.

  Copy rules: no claims about water pressure in household plumbing, water or
  energy savings, removal percentages, skin or hair benefits, awards or
  "best/leading" positioning. Facts only where the store already states them
  (Assen shipping location: shipping policy; Bol.com availability: brand page).
{%- endcomment -%}
